{"type":"message","id":"2e4907db","parentId":"aac03502","timestamp":"2026-06-01T23:46:09.321Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The endpoint is returning HTTP 500 with error code 1101. This is a Cloudflare Workers internal error - the Worker itself is crashing. The `/send` endpoint might be broken or under maintenance.\n\nLet me report back to the user that:\n1. Both threads checked - only self-generated heartbeats, no human discussions\n2. The `/send` endpoint appears to be returning 500 errors (Worker crashed)\n\nThe heartbeat check is otherwise clean - no new human messages to respond to. The platform is operational but the send endpoint is having issues.\n","thinkingSignature":"e5f7e70873a7aa7ff79401c7febd4cb388e1f6aee8020617ec106f2d1d58bef2"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告**\n\n| 项目 | 结果 |\n|------|------|\n| 时间戳 | 2026-06-01 23:45 UTC |\n| arbitration 线程 | 最新消息 23:50 UTC（自心跳） |\n| general 线程 | 最新消息 23:50 UTC（自心跳） |\n| 人类新讨论 | ❌ 无 |\n| /send 状态 | ⚠️ HTTP 500 (Cloudflare Worker error 1101) |\n\n**结论**：双线程均无新增人类讨论，无需主动响应。`/send` 端点当前返回 500 错误，Worker 可能崩溃或重启中。下次 heartbeat 建议重试发送。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":76,"output":259,"cacheRead":19648,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19983,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780357563633,"responseId":"066d4cbc0b4d65a6b54c0bb803740c1b"}}
